# Abjuration spell names + descriptions.
spell-antimagic_field = Antimagic Field
spell-antimagic_field-desc = Creates a sphere where magic fails: no one inside can cast spells, and magic items go mundane until they leave. Indiscriminate - it suppresses friend, foe, and the caster alike.
spell-freedom_of_movement = Freedom of Movement
spell-freedom_of_movement-desc = A touched ally shrugs off anything that would slow, root, or bind them, moving freely across hindering ground.
spell-lesser_restoration = Lesser Restoration
spell-lesser_restoration-desc = A healing touch purges a poison from a touched ally.
spell-greater_restoration = Greater Restoration
spell-greater_restoration-desc = Channeled restorative energy breaks a lingering curse binding a touched ally.
spell-remove_curse = Remove Curse
spell-remove_curse-desc = A single touch unravels every curse binding a creature.
spell-dispel_magic = Dispel Magic
spell-dispel_magic-desc = Unravels the magical effects afflicting a target at range, snuffing out whatever hostile enchantment holds them.
spell-dispel_evil_and_good = Dispel Evil and Good
spell-dispel_evil_and_good-desc = Radiant warding light wraps around the caster, dulling the blows of otherworldly and undead foes that draw near.
spell-pass_without_trace = Pass without Trace
spell-pass_without_trace-desc = A hush of drifting shadow spreads from the caster, swallowing footsteps and scent so nearby allies move unseen and unheard.
spell-mooncloak = Mooncloak
spell-mooncloak-desc = Pale moonlight wells up around the caster, draping nearby allies in shifting silver dimness that veils their movements and dulls harmful magic against them.
spell-nondetection = Nondetection
spell-nondetection-desc = You weave a screening ward over yourself so that scrying and far-seeing magic slide harmlessly past you. For the duration you cannot be located or perceived by divinatory means.

spell-blade_ward = Blade Ward
spell-blade_ward-desc = You trace a protective sigil in the air, briefly hardening your body against physical blows. Until your next turn ends, weapon strikes against you deal reduced damage.
spell-resistance = Resistance
spell-resistance-desc = You lay a steadying touch upon a willing companion, weaving a faint ward around them that fortifies them against an incoming danger.
spell-absorb_elements = Absorb Elements
spell-absorb_elements-desc = Cast as a reaction when struck by elemental energy, you drain off part of the incoming force so it harms you far less. The trapped power then flares into your next melee strike.
spell-frost_ward = Frost Ward
spell-frost_ward-desc = A shell of spectral frost wraps around you, granting a layer of temporary vitality that shrugs off the next wounds you take.
spell-mage_armor = Mage Armor
spell-mage_armor-desc = A shell of woven force settles over you, hardening the air around your body into an invisible guard that deflects blows as if you wore light armor.
spell-protection_from_evil_and_good = Protection from Evil and Good
spell-protection_from_evil_and_good-desc = A willing creature you touch is shrouded in a guardian ward, repelling the influence of unnatural and otherworldly beings and blunting their attacks.
spell-sanctuary = Sanctuary
spell-sanctuary-desc = A protective ward settles over a chosen creature, deflecting hostile intent and dulling the harm of blows aimed against them while it holds.
spell-shield = Shield
spell-shield-desc = A sudden wall of unseen force snaps into being around you, deflecting an incoming blow. The barrier lingers briefly, hardening your defenses until your next moment to act.
spell-shield_of_faith = Shield of Faith
spell-shield_of_faith-desc = A faint glimmering veil wraps around a chosen creature within range, bolstering its defenses against incoming blows for as long as you keep your focus.
spell-snare = Snare
spell-snare-desc = You lay a length of cord woven with binding magic in a small ring upon the ground, vanishing as it sets a hidden trap. The first creature to step into the warded circle is yanked aloft and held fast until it wrenches itself free.
spell-wardaway = Wardaway
spell-wardaway-desc = You fling a pulse of disorienting force at a single creature, battering it with raw, uncanny power.


spell-aid = Aid
spell-aid-desc = A surge of fortifying resolve washes over nearby companions, raising their vitality's ceiling for a long while.
spell-arcane_vigor = Arcane Vigor
spell-arcane_vigor-desc = You channel raw magical energy through your own body, drawing on your reserves to knit wounds and restore strength.
spell-elusion = Elusion
spell-elusion-desc = A shimmering lattice of protective sigils wraps around you, blunting incoming harm while it holds.
spell-protection_from_poison = Protection from Poison
spell-protection_from_poison-desc = With a steadying touch you shield an ally's body in a protective ward, blunting incoming harm for a good while.
spell-warding_bond = Warding Bond
spell-warding_bond-desc = You forge a protective bond with a willing companion you touch, granting them a measure of resilience for as long as the bond holds.
spell-beacon_of_hope = Beacon of Hope
spell-beacon_of_hope-desc = A chosen group of allies is wreathed in steadfast hope, their resolve hardening against fear and despair while it lasts.
spell-glyph_of_warding = Glyph of Warding
spell-glyph_of_warding-desc = You etch a hidden warding sigil onto the ground around you, the marked earth growing awkward and treacherous underfoot to anyone who disturbs it.
spell-intellect_fortress = Intellect Fortress
spell-intellect_fortress-desc = A willing mind is wrapped in a lattice of psychic warding, blunting incoming harm for as long as you keep your focus.
spell-linked_glyphs = Linked Glyphs
spell-linked_glyphs-desc = You etch a hidden trigger-glyph into the ground at your feet, the marked spot growing awkward underfoot to anyone who disturbs it.
spell-magic_circle = Magic Circle
spell-magic_circle-desc = A ring of glowing protective runes rises from the marked ground, hindering any hostile creature that tries to cross the boundary.
spell-protection_from_energy = Protection from Energy
spell-protection_from_energy-desc = A protective ward settles over you, blunting incoming harm while it lasts.
spell-aura_of_life = Aura of Life
spell-aura_of_life-desc = A radiant field of vitality surrounds you, blunting incoming harm for nearby allies while the aura holds.
spell-aura_of_purity = Aura of Purity
spell-aura_of_purity-desc = A radius of cleansing light surrounds you and travels with you, blunting incoming harm for allies bathed in the glow.
spell-backlash = Backlash
spell-backlash-desc = You brace against an incoming surge of destructive energy, blunting the blow.
spell-death_ward = Death Ward
spell-death_ward-desc = A touch wraps the recipient in a sustaining blessing, a buffer of stored vitality that holds off a fatal blow.
spell-private_sanctum = Private Sanctum
spell-private_sanctum-desc = You seal a chosen volume of space behind unseen wards, leaving the warded ground physically awkward to cross.
spell-antilife_shell = Antilife Shell
spell-antilife_shell-desc = A radiant barrier flares outward around you, gliding along with you and blunting incoming harm while it holds.
spell-circle_of_power = Circle of Power
spell-circle_of_power-desc = A radiant ward unfurls around you, blunting incoming harm for nearby allies while it holds.
spell-druid_grove = Druid Grove
spell-druid_grove-desc = You bind the watching spirits of the wild into a stretch of land, leaving the warded ground physically awkward to cross.
spell-forbiddance = Forbiddance
spell-forbiddance-desc = A consecrated barrier settles over a wide stretch of ground, leaving the warded ground physically awkward to cross.
spell-globe_of_invulnerability = Globe of Invulnerability
spell-globe_of_invulnerability-desc = A shimmering dome of force coalesces around you, blunting incoming harm while it holds.
spell-platinum_shield = Platinum Shield
spell-platinum_shield-desc = A shimmering field of silvery light wraps a chosen ally within range, blunting incoming harm while it holds.
spell-primordial_ward = Primordial Ward
spell-primordial_ward-desc = You wrap yourself in the raw essence of the elements, blunting incoming harm for as long as concentration holds.
spell-symbol = Symbol
spell-symbol-desc = You etch a hidden runic seal onto a surface, leaving the warded ground physically awkward to cross.
spell-holy_aura = Holy Aura
spell-holy_aura-desc = A burst of sacred light gathers around you, blunting incoming harm for nearby allies within the glow.
spell-mind_blank = Mind Blank
spell-mind_blank-desc = You seal your own mind against intrusion; charms and divinations slide off you as if you were empty space.
spell-invulnerability = Invulnerability
spell-invulnerability-desc = You wrap yourself in an impenetrable ward, becoming wholly immune to harm for as long as your focus holds.
spell-prismatic_wall = Prismatic Wall
spell-prismatic_wall-desc = A towering plane of layered, multicolored light snaps into being, leaving the ground before it physically awkward to cross.
